---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Future Plans" description="Sarvagun Society's future plans — agro training, health camps, girl education sponsorship, value education workshops.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing_page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Future Plans</h1>
      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">School Infrastructure</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted">Schools lacking proper sanitation, water supply, and basic education facilities will be given adequate help.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">Agro-Based Training</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted">In collaboration with Ramakrishna Mission, Dehradun, short-term training programs on Bio Fertilizer, Vermi Compost, Drip Water, Bio Gas, and Bee Keeping for farmers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">Free Health Checkup Camps</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted">Health checkup camps in interior village schools for vaccinations and medication.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">Girl Child Education Sponsorship</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted">Financial help for girls who cannot continue higher education due to financial problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">Value Education Workshops</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted">Workshops on value education and personality development in Hindi medium schools, including guided meditation, multimedia projections, and group discussions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-6 lg:p-8 mt-8">
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm italic">"Your little help can bring a change in somebody's life. Any help given to Sarvagun Society in cash or kind will be exempted under 80G of Income Tax Act 1961."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
